### CSS Styling

Add some CSS to style the loading indicator:

```css
.spinner {
  border: 4px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  border-left-color: #000;
  border-radius: 50%;
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
}

